# Input

```md
>>> bar
>>> ===

- in list
    - in list
      heading
      =======
    - in list
      >>> heading
      >>> =======

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -4,5 +4,5 @@
   - in list
     heading
     =======
-  - in list
-    > > > # heading
+    - in list
+      > > > # heading
```

# Output

```md
> > > # bar

- in list
  - in list
    heading
    =======
    - in list
      > > > # heading
```
